# Curriculum Architecture Improvements (Updated Plan)

This plan combines all decisions from our review sessions.

### Summary of All Decisions
| # | Decision | Status |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Editions Pattern** — introduce `curriculum_versions` for year-to-year versioning | ✅ Agreed |
| 2 | **Flat + Nested lessons** — `topic_id` nullable on `curriculum_lessons` | ✅ Agreed |
| 3 | **Remove `active` from `curricula`** — status lives in `curriculum_versions` only | ✅ Agreed |
| 4 | **`curriculum_maps` links to `curriculum_version_id`** not `curriculum_id` | ✅ Agreed |
| 5 | **Drop standalone `lessons` table** and `App\Models\Lesson` (confirmed safe) | ✅ Agreed |
| 6 | **Granular skill tagging** — `skills` + `skillables` pivot table | ✅ Agreed |
| 7 | **Gamification hooks** — JSON column on `curriculum_lesson_plans` | ✅ Agreed |
| 8 | **JSON Cast enforcement** — DTOs/Casts for `weekly_plan` and `plan` columns | ✅ Agreed |

## Proposed Changes

### Phase A: The Editions Pattern (Versioning Core)

Replace individual lesson soft-deletion with a full curriculum versioning system.

#### [MODIFY] [curricula table](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/2024_11_30_130314_create_curricula_table.php)
- Remove the `active` tinyInteger column. The `curricula` table now only holds permanent metadata: `name`, `school_id`, `grade_id`, `subject_id`, `description`, and timestamps.

#### [NEW] `curriculum_versions` table
- `id`, `curriculum_id` (FK → `curricula`), `title`, `academic_year`, `status` (enum: `draft`, `active`, `archived`), `version_number`, timestamps.

#### [MODIFY] [curriculum_topics table](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/2024_11_30_130327_create_curriculum_topics_table.php)
- Change `curriculum_id` FK → `curriculum_version_id` (FK → `curriculum_versions`).

#### [MODIFY] [curriculum_lessons table](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/2024_11_30_130328_create_curriculum_lessons_table.php)
- Add `curriculum_version_id` (FK → `curriculum_versions`) for flat support.
- Make `topic_id` **nullable** — allows both flat (no topic) and nested (with topic) curricula.
- Remove `school_id` (it is inherited through `curriculum_version → curriculum → school`).
- **No more** `SoftDeletes` or `version` column — versioning is handled at the `curriculum_versions` level.

#### [MODIFY] [curriculum_maps table](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/2025_05_22_064638_create_curriculum_maps_table.php)
- Replace `curriculum_id` with `curriculum_version_id` (FK → `curriculum_versions`). Teachers always map a specific edition.

---

### Phase B: Granular Skill Tagging

Extract text-based skills for gap analysis.

#### [NEW] `skills` table
- `id`, `name`, `domain`, `standard`, timestamps.

#### [NEW] `skillables` polymorphic pivot table
- `skill_id`, `skillable_id`, `skillable_type` — attach skills to `curriculum_lessons` and assessment questions.

#### [MODIFY] [curriculum_lessons table](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/2024_11_30_130328_create_curriculum_lessons_table.php)
- Remove the free-text `skill` and `objective` columns (replaced by the pivot).

---

### Phase C: Gamification Integration

#### [MODIFY] [curriculum_lesson_plans table](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/2025_05_22_025858_create_curriculum_lesson_plans_table.php)
- Add `gamification_hooks` JSON column (e.g., `{events: [{trigger: 'completion', points: 10, badge_id: 5}] }`).

---

### Phase D: Cleanup — Remove Legacy Flat Lessons

#### [DELETE] [2025_05_20_000000_create_lessons_table.php](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/2025_05_20_000000_create_lessons_table.php)
- Confirmed safe: no controller, route, or Vue component actively uses it.

#### [DELETE] [App\Models\Lesson.php](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/App/Models/Lesson.php)
- Remove the orphaned [Lesson](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/app/Models/Lesson.php#9-178) model. The only reference is an unused relationship in [Subject.php](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/app/Models/Subject.php) which will also be cleaned up.

#### [MODIFY] [Subject.php](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/app/Models/Subject.php) Model
- Remove the `hasMany(Lesson::class)` relationship.

---

### Phase E: JSON Cast Enforcement

#### [NEW] `app/Casts/WeeklyPlanCast.php`
#### [NEW] `app/Casts/LessonPlanCast.php`
- Custom Cast classes to enforce a strict JSON schema before data is serialized/deserialized.

#### [MODIFY] `CurriculumMap.php` Model
- Apply `WeeklyPlanCast` to the `weekly_plan` column.

#### [MODIFY] [CurriculumLessonPlan.php](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/app/Models/CurriculumLessonPlan.php) Model
- Apply `LessonPlanCast` to the `plan` column.

---

## Architectural Flow (Final)

```text
[Curriculum] Grade 4 Math (school, grade, subject)
   |
   |---> [Version 1] 2024/2025 — Archived
   |        |---> [Topic: Fractions]
   |        |       |---> [Lesson: Intro to Fractions (ID:10)] <--- Old teacher plans
   |        |---> [Lesson: Standalone (no topic, ID:11)] -- Flat lesson
   |
   |---> [Version 2] 2025/2026 — Active
            |---> [Topic: Fractions]
            |       |---> [Lesson: Intro to Fractions (ID:45)] <--- New teacher plans
```

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Migration runs without error.
- Cloning a `curriculum_version` duplicates all nested topics and lessons with new IDs.
- Old `curriculum_lesson_plans` remain linked to original lesson IDs after cloning.
- Skill pivot attaches/detaches correctly from lessons.
- JSON Casts reject malformed payloads.

### Manual Verification
- Confirm no existing controller breaks after removing `school_id` from `curriculum_lessons`.
- Verify the `curriculum_maps` query filters correctly by `curriculum_version_id`.
